 "titulo": "A bell rang under the frozen lake 🔔 Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "THE BELL WAS REMOVED IN 1950",
 "descripcion": "Wes went ice fishing on a lake that drowned a whole town. At 2:14 AM, a church bell rang under his feet.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you look down the hole?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "There's a whole town at the bottom of Lake Ardell.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "They flooded it in 1950. Only the church steeple still sticks out of the ice.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I'm Wes. I've fished that lake for twenty winters.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The old man at the bait shop gives everyone three rules.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay a hundred steps from the steeple.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "If you hear the bell, pull your line and walk to shore.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And never look down your hole after midnight.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "That night, I set up sixty steps from the steeple.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Minus twenty outside. A heater, a radio, a thermos of coffee.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 2:14 AM, I heard a bell. Deep and slow. Coming from under the ice.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "That steeple has no bell. They took it out before the flood.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Rule two. Pull your line. I grabbed it, and it was heavy.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Not a fish. Something pulled back, slow and steady.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I cut the line. It was already past midnight.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And I broke rule three. I looked down the hole.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Far below, there were yellow lights. Little squares, in rows. Like windows.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then someone knocked on the ice. Right under my boots.",
   "pausa": 0.9
  },
  {
   "texto": "Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
